   "type": "events",
   "id": "584169",
   "attributes": {
    "id": 584169,
    "title": "The 10th Montreal Photonics Networking Event",
    "description": "<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://events.vtools.ieee.org/vtools_ui/media/display/bbe6b7dc-360d-4960-ae9d-f82499b42cbb\" width=\"597\" height=\"336\"></p>\r\n<p>You are invited to attend the 10th Montreal Photonics Networking Event on Friday 4th December 2026.</p>\r\n<p>The Montreal Photonics Networking Event is an annual event that brings together students doing research in photonics, as well as the local industry and innovation ecosystem. The event features a poster competition with several prizes and various networking activities to foster professional development. The event&rsquo;s mission is to bring together graduate students to (1) establish a way for students to discuss life as a photonics researcher, (2) enhance research synergies, and (3) connect with the industry for further career development.</p>\r\n<p>-----------------</p>\r\n<p>Vous &ecirc;tes invit&eacute;&middot;e&middot;s &agrave; participer au 10e &eacute;v&eacute;nement de r&eacute;seautage en photonique de Montr&eacute;al le vendredi 4 d&eacute;cembre 2026.</p>\r\n<p>Le Montreal Photonics Networking Event est un &eacute;v&eacute;nement annuel qui rassemble les &eacute;tudiant&middot;e&middot;s qui font de la recherche en photonique, ainsi que l'industrie locale et l'&eacute;cosyst&egrave;me de l'innovation. L'&eacute;v&eacute;nement comprend un concours d'affiches dot&eacute; de plusieurs prix et diverses activit&eacute;s de r&eacute;seautage visant &agrave; favoriser le d&eacute;veloppement professionnel. La mission de l'&eacute;v&eacute;nement est de rassembler les &eacute;tudiant&middot;e&middot;s (1) permettre aux &eacute;tudiant.e.s d'&eacute;change sur la vie de chercheur&middot;e en photonique, (2) am&eacute;liorer les synergies de recherche, et (3) rencontrer des repr&eacute;sentant&middot;e&middot;s de l'industrie pour d&eacute;velopper de nouvelles perspectives de carri&egrave;re</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "start-time": "2026-12-04T14:00:00.000Z",
    "end-time": "2026-12-04T22:00:00.000Z",
